B.ZG=s(["Spray Tricyclazole 75% WP @ 0.6 g/liter of water immediately","Spray Isoprothiolane 40% EC @ 1.5 ml/liter","Avoid standing water logging in affected field areas","Do not apply top-dress Nitrogen fertilizer during outbreak"],t.s)
